| ''`FileSystemSyncAccessHandle`'' (sync read/write, dedicated workers only) | 90 (102 sync) | 15.1 (16.4 sync) | 111 | spec IDL `[Exposed=DedicatedWorker]` (fs.spec.whatwg.org, 2026-03-15); MDN "run inside web workers only so as not to block the main thread" | the island worker at `browser-sovereign-island-model.ts:37-47`; not called anywhere in `packages/` | ''COULD RIDE'' (#/moves 3) |
