| ''File System Access'' (`showDirectoryPicker`, persisted permission) | 86 | ''oppose'' (WebKit #28, 2023-02-08) | ''negative'' (Mozilla #154, 2020-08-05 "harmful"; #738 subset "defer" 2023-01-24) | quotes under #/refusals-and-floors | `disk-projection` stays a node seat; `open-browser-vessel.ts:8-10` "IndexedDB storage … genesis-via-bytes/IDB/OPFS/peer" | ''FLOORS'' — OPFS-only projection everywhere; picker = Chromium offer |
